This product bundles the Simplified Chinese translations taken from the JetBrains
language pack "Chinese (Simplified) Language Pack / 中文语言包" (plugin id com.intellij.zh),
which JetBrains ships inside IntelliJ IDEA and which is distributed under the Apache
License 2.0 together with the JetBrains Open Source Build Terms
(https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community/blob/master/LICENSE.txt).

Modifications made by this project before redistribution:

  - merged additional translations from translations/ over the upstream bundles;
  - exported part of them as messages/*_zh_CN.properties for the boot class path;
  - added an applicationInitializedListener to plugin.xml that relabels actions by id;
  - relaxed idea-version to AI-0 / AI-999.* and dropped the build-time __index__ entry.

